<task id="109" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Bicep: fix config-key/audience/secret-name source drift (C5.1-C5.3)</title>
    <phase>C'' Wave G-1 -- Foundation</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Bicep appSettings array FULLY REPLACES the App Service's settings on redeploy -- ordering-critical per DS-5: this MUST land before any stamp redeploy or the redeploy bricks the running service by wiping live manual aliases. FULL rigor + prescriptive.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Well-specified key-rename diff against a documented code-vs-Bicep mismatch table -- mechanical, Sonnet @ high.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
