    <constraint source="DS-5 ordering rule">This task (C5.1+C5.2) MUST land before ANY subsequent Wave G Bicep task performs a stamp redeploy -- sequence it first among the startable G-1 tasks, alongside task 108 (queue) which is independent.</constraint>
