  <steps mode="prescriptive">
    <step order="0" name="Rigor + load">Emit RIGOR LEVEL (FULL). Read DS-5's Category-5 table rows C5.1-C5.3 in full plus CosmosModule.cs:98-131 and ServiceBusModule.cs:53-102,157 for the authoritative key names.</step>
    <step order="1" name="C5.1 rename">Rename the 3 Cosmos keys, replace the ServiceBus connection-string KV-ref with FullyQualifiedNamespace+QueueName, add ManagedIdentity__ClientId.</step>
    <step order="2" name="C5.1 cleanup">Remove serviceBusKeyVaultSecretName param + its secret plumbing from platform-controlplane.bicep:101.</step>
    <step order="3" name="C5.2 audience">Update jwtAudience var + its FR-20 comment block to the spaarke.com/ form.</step>
    <step order="4" name="C5.3 deprecation mark">Update dataverseClientSecretName's @description to note deprecated-pending-C1.4 (task 111/112 will remove it); do NOT remove the param or the KV dummy binding in THIS task.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Validate">az bicep build -- zero new errors.</step>
    <step order="6" name="What-if">az deployment sub what-if against dev -- confirm the app-setting diff is EXACTLY the key renames + audience change + no other unintended drift.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
